WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.250
<b>One Piece</b>

3
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.250
<b>Wano Arc</b>

4
00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:44.210
<b>Seppuku</b>

5
00:02:54.360 --> 00:03:01.790
<b>Wano Country</b>

6
00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.990
Come and get your freshwater clams!

7
00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:07.350
Move outta my way!

8
00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.940
Come one, come all, don't be shy!

9
00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:15.780
Our famous Flower Udon
is waiting for you!

10
00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:35.250
Hmm?

11
00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:51.730
We're short-handed here.

12
00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.440
Could you lend me some help?

13
00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.150
Hey! Carry the other end!

14
00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:00.130
Bah! Hey you, Greenhorn!

15
00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.000
Yeah, the new guy!

16
00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.880
Tell me, is this your work up here?

17
00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:05.670
Well, answer me, boy!

18
00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.600
You bet! Is there a problem?

19
00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:11.340
Or do you just wanna shout?

20
00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:15.240
Now listen up! You fool!

21
00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.610
Your woodwork's utterly perfect!

22
00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.160
Nice job! You damn fool!

23
00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.000
Of course, it's perfect! Because I...

24
00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.500
You must maintain your role!

25
00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:36.900
Gotcha. I'm happy to hear it then.

26
00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.150
Thank you, sir!

27
00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:41.910
That guy's an asshole!

28
00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.800
<b>Franosuke



Carpenter</b>

29
00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.830
Step right up, folks!

30
00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.250
C'mon! Gather 'round everyone!

31
00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:55.950
Here's an ordinary sheet of paper,
no gimmicks or setup here!

32
00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.830
One sheet becomes two!

33
00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.580
Two sheets become four!

34
00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.080
But it doesn't end there, folks!

35
00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:05.380
Four sheets become eight!
Eight to 16, and then 32 to 64!

36
00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.000
Are you following me?

37
00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.930
And just like the cherry blossom petals

38
00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:16.890
or snow fall at Wano's dusk,
you too can make a flurry of paper,

39
00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:18.470
with little to no effort!

40
00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.280
Take witness!

41
00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:33.080
I shall now demonstrate how
razor-sharp this sword truly is!

42
00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.500
Ha! Watch as I graze my skin!

43
00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:39.000
Behold! A laceration!

44
00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.890
Now if I may direct
your attention here!

45
00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:51.480
What I'm holding in
my palm is toad oil!

46
00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:56.480
Just apply a dab and watch
what it does to my wound.

47
00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.610
Voila!

48
00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.280
Look! You see that?

49
00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:05.790
A mere touch patches it up!

50
00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.460
It's all healed! And no bleeding!

51
00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:12.230
This special toad oil
hails from the East Blue!

52
00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:14.270
Now, do I have any takers?

53
00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:15.690
I'll take some!

54
00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.610
Wise folks, if I do say so!

55
00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:22.650
Now! Let's make one line
and don't shove!

56
00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:25.450
<b>Usohachi



Toad Oil

Salesman</b>

57
00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:35.800
Ooh, irresistible!

58
00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:40.180
Yes! Yes, that's the stuff right there!

59
00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.680
Raise your arm a bit more!

60
00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:46.350
And don't forget to
keep those hips low!

61
00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:49.440
Yes, ma'am.

62
00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:54.790
What you're hoping to achieve is nigh on
impossible, so you need to push yourself!

63
00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:59.640
Not just any old gal receives a summons
to the shogun's chamber, let alone in

64
00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.510
such a short amount of time!

65
00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:04.020
Ow, ow, ow!

66
00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.390
Oh, oh, oh, oh! That's it!

67
00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:10.440
Keep it up, baby! Yeah!

68
00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:14.900
Yes, ma'am.

69
00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:19.920
<b>Orobi



Geisha</b>

70
00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:32.900
That's some good saké.

71
00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:39.180
<b>Zorojuro



Ronin</b>

72
00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.030
I'll come back soon.

73
00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.360
Thank you for your business!

74
00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:52.660
Well, look at that. Beautiful.

75
00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.920
I should buy another round
and find a spot to moongaze.

76
00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:26.820
The smell of blood?

77
00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:29.100
What's the rush?

78
00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.250
You're smelling pretty good there, bud.

79
00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:35.960
Is that blood-scented perfume on you?

80
00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:37.590
Where'd ya pick that up?

81
00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.800
"Arrest"

82
00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:57.540
You're under arrest!
So stay right there!

83
00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.130
You're the murderer!

84
00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.170
Don't resist!

85
00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:01.170
I wasn't.

86
00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:03.250
We'll be taking you in, slasher!

87
00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.050
Don't move! Surrender!

88
00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:07.340
It's over. Drop the swords!

89
00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:12.050
Since apparently I'm in some trouble,

90
00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:16.220
I'll have to defend myself.
Okay, let's do this!

91
00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.180
You must maintain your role!

92
00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:23.520
Listen, closely.
You are in the Land of Wano.

93
00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:25.570
We have a Shogun.

94
00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.530
Remember his name.

95
00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.280
Kurozumi Orochi!

96
00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:33.410
Do keep in mind that any
officials who do his bidding

97
00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:36.620
all have ties to
the Emperor Kaido, himself!

98
00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.580
Thus, these men are rogues!

99
00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.170
Arrogant and corrupt.

100
00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:45.030
That's why, if you harm them,
Kaido will be the first to hear of it!

101
00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:48.370
We must not allow our
existence to be known

102
00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.790
until our allies can
assemble with us once more.

103
00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.110
Only then can preparations begin.

104
00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.860
It is essential that you blend in

105
00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:58.690
seamlessly with the locals.

106
00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:01.820
You'll live quietly and
go about your business.

107
00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:03.070
It is your duty!

108
00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:05.820
Keep the peace! Am I clear?

109
00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.580
Guess I got no choice.

110
00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.620
On my honor. I surrender.

111
00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.750
Go! Grab him!

112
00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:29.100
The menacing scourge who was
terrorizing our town is now in custody!

113
00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:32.690
Our brave magistrate has finally
apprehended that scoundrel!

114
00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.650
As punishment, he's being
sentenced to seppuku!

115
00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:39.610
You can read about the rest of
the details right in here!

116
00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.900
Good riddance!

117
00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:44.280
He's the man that
murdered my poor husband!

118
00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.740
What a relief!

119
00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:50.160
I was worried this place would never be
safe again after the three recent slashings!

120
00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:57.000
'Scuse me! You mind if
I get one of those?

121
00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:58.550
Sure! Here ya go!

122
00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.520
"The Slasher, Zorojuro"

123
00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:13.970
So your name is Zorojuro, is it?

124
00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:19.480
Your carnage has stricken fear
into the hearts of our populace.

125
00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:25.360
If you do the honorable thing and commit
seppuku, our town shall be peaceful again.

126
00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:29.530
Well, look at that! How funny.

127
00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:33.030
Apparently, you're a
grave-robber as well?

128
00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:38.580
Twenty-three years ago,
amidst a pirate upheaval,

129
00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:41.040
the whereabouts of
a legendary blade and

130
00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:44.170
the corpse of its owner,
Ryuma, went missing.

131
00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:47.260
The name of his famed blade was Shusui.

132
00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:52.640
Legend has it that Ryuma chopped the head
off a giant dragon with this sword.

133
00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:58.100
And now I hold it
in my hands. Incredible.

134
00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:02.150
Just how old are you? I'm curious.

135
00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:06.130
That infamous grave-robbery
took place over two decades ago.

136
00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:08.630
You seem a bit young to have done that.

137
00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:12.290
Did you steal it from the thief?

138
00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:19.000
It doesn't matter.
I possess the sword now.

139
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.330
And what a fine treasure it is!

140
00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.120
Hm?

141
00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:30.920
Sir! The time is upon us,
Zorojuro, are you ready?

142
00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:38.760
Huh? What gives?
This blade's got no hilt.

143
00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:40.670
Uh...

144
00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.000
Your mightiness.

145
00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:47.840
There's no need for one as it's
not a weapon forged for battle.

146
00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:50.340
The knife's short and lacks a handle.

147
00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.760
It's on purpose, you imbecile!

148
00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:56.390
Are you making jest of the
situation in your final moments?

149
00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.940
If you have any pride as a samurai,

150
00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:02.270
admit your guilt and make
amends with your death.

151
00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:05.230
I'll make sure you don't
suffer in your passing.

152
00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.110
It is my duty!

153
00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.580
In that case, farewell.

154
00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.670
Don't cry like a baby.

155
00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.960
When a samurai meets his ends,
he needs to do the honorable thing.

156
00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:46.680
Your guilt is certain and
your crimes were unspeakable.

157
00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.430
You are receiving an honorable
death that you hardly deserve.

158
00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.500
Take pride in your seppuku.

159
00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:13.300
I can still smell the scent of blood.

160
00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:21.180
It's from you. You're the slasher!

161
00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:51.710
I had to. Sorry, Kin'emon.

162
00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:34.570
So we made it then. Wano.

163
00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.200
Where is everybody?

164
00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.620
Lemme think.

165
00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:00.710
What happened to us again? Let's see.

166
00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:25.420
You jerk! You better not
have broken our ship!

167
00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:29.510
It's a giant dog!

168
00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:34.390
Wait, or is it a boar?

169
00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.910
<b>A Baboon</b>

170
00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:58.620
Wait, or is it a boar?

171
00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.520
Why's that ape have a sword?

172
00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:05.400
I guess this really is
the Land of Wano.

173
00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:15.870
Wild sword monkey
versus wild dog thing?

174
00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:18.040
Wano's a pretty crazy place!

175
00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.610
Hey, you two!

176
00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:51.280
You can fight each other all you want,
just don't do it near my ship!

177
00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:03.030
Let's see. What was I doing again?

178
00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:11.720
When we climbed up the waterfall,
we saw land for a split second,

179
00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:14.840
but then we got sucked
into that big whirlpool!

180
00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:16.970
What's happening?

181
00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:19.850
I think that the tide is
running in reverse somehow.

182
00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.050
Just hang in there, Sunny!

183
00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.850
Don't worry, Nami. I got you.

184
00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:29.600
I appreciate it, Sanji!

185
00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.500
Oh, it's my pleasure, I assure you!

186
00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.670
Sanji!

187
00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:34.840
Grab onto me!

188
00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:38.340
Good! Now, I'm gonna jump us to safety!

189
00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:40.720
You ready?

190
00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:41.930
Sanji, wait!

191
00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:47.190
You gotta take me with you!

192
00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.650
Hang on, Chobro!

193
00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:50.150
I got a weight limit here!

194
00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:53.950
C'mon now! You can't leave me behind!

195
00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.080
You're on your own for this one, bud.

196
00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.290
How could you?

197
00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:01.500
I'm just kidding.

198
00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.210
I've always got your back, Chopper.

199
00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.540
Sanji!

200
00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:09.300
I hope you all
saved room for one more!

201
00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:13.690
Let's bring it in! Love ya!

202
00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:17.030
No offense, but you're kinda pokey!

203
00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:19.330
You're way too close!
Brook, stop being gross!

204
00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:21.310
Hey! Use my belly to bounce.

205
00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:22.480
Sound good?

206
00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:25.690
It's a plan!

207
00:19:30.110 --> 00:19:31.700
See you soon, Luffy!

208
00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:34.410
Yeah! I'll be right behind you guys!

209
00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.540
Alrighty! You be good, Sunny! Okay?

210
00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:43.330
I promise to come find
you when it's safer!

211
00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:51.090
Here I go!

212
00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.620
The octopus?

213
00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:59.020
What do you even want from me? Huh?

214
00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:04.440
Stupid octopus!

215
00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.650
Oh yeah. That must be why
I woke up on this beach.

216
00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:26.240
Am I still above the waterfall?
Or is this below it?

217
00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.700
I can't tell if this is Wano or not.

218
00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.710
Crap! The Vivre Card!

219
00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:41.410
Where did it go? Is it in the sea?

220
00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.220
Dammit!

221
00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.790
Oh, well. Whatever.

222
00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:55.160
Stop! Lemme go already!

223
00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.580
I didn't say nothin' like that!

224
00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:59.630
And gimme back my rice, too!

225
00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:02.050
I know what I heard.

226
00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:06.310
The Kozuki Clan is gonna come back!

227
00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:08.690
And then you'll pay!

228
00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.300
You traitor.

229
00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:14.390
You've chosen to ally yourself
with a bunch of villains, have you?

230
00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:17.640
That's a serious crime
and there'll be no mercy!

231
00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:21.040
As punishment, we'll either sell you
to a brothel or toss you in jail.

232
00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:22.610
But, mister!

233
00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:23.820
Aw, shut your trap!

234
00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:26.660
Enough. We've got a job to do.

235
00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:31.200
Look! There's a ship on the beach!

236
00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.870
Just one survivor?

237
00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:35.730
The baboon's still
battling the lion-dog?

238
00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:39.530
I thought he was at least strong
enough to take care of that puny thing!

239
00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.110
Komachiyo?

240
00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:48.120
Okay, guys, knock it off already.

241
00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:50.450
There it is! We found the ship, sir!

242
00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.660
Looks like the report was correct.

243
00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.320
Can you see its crew?

244
00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:55.610
Just one man.

245
00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:57.410
How interesting.

246
00:21:57.410 --> 00:21:59.410
We'll knock him out
and bring him back with us!

247
00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:02.510
I think he'll make for
a good laborer, sir!

248
00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:10.640
Heheh. That's a good boy,
just stay right there.

249
00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:15.770
When you wake up, we'll have a surprise
for you: a lifetime of slavery!

250
00:22:37.180 --> 00:22:38.930
Who just attacked me?

251
00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:40.720
You bastard!

252
00:22:45.470 --> 00:22:46.890
Huh?

253
00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.020
Hey. What's going on?

254
00:22:50.020 --> 00:22:53.820
Uh. Nothing, sir!

255
00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:10.920
This beach is popular, huh?

256
00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:15.960
Damn. You stupid baboon!

257
00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:18.880
Don't just stand there!
You gotta do something!

258
00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:22.470
Forget the mutt for now!
Catch that guy!

259
00:23:27.470 --> 00:23:29.350
Actually, you know what?

260
00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:31.060
Go ahead and kill him!

261
00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:04.300
Do you want something?

262
00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:38.160
Heh. Good! Now, you two
play nice and get along, okay!

263
00:24:39.660 --> 00:24:41.960
Why the hell are you

264
00:24:41.960 --> 00:24:43.580
bowing your head like that?

265
00:24:43.580 --> 00:24:46.630
It's just one measly pirate, you fool!

266
00:25:00.140 --> 00:25:03.850
You miserable brat! I'll make you pay!

267
00:25:05.190 --> 00:25:07.020
You are gonna die for that one!

268
00:25:08.230 --> 00:25:10.530
There's no use running from me!

269
00:25:10.530 --> 00:25:12.490
I'm really sorry, mister!

270
00:25:19.940 --> 00:25:23.900
I surrender! I surrender!

271
00:25:24.450 --> 00:25:26.620
What are you doing? Weirdo.

272
00:25:26.990 --> 00:25:31.240
I said I surrender!
This is the surrender pose!

273
00:25:31.680 --> 00:25:35.010
<b>Otama</b>

274
00:25:36.080 --> 00:25:38.370
I wasn't gonna do
anything to you though!

275
00:25:38.370 --> 00:25:41.330
Really? Do you mean it, sir?

276
00:25:41.710 --> 00:25:42.920
Yeah, of course.

277
00:25:43.290 --> 00:25:48.170
Okay, then maybe, if you're not gonna
kill me, could I ask for a favor?

278
00:25:48.170 --> 00:25:49.750
An itty-bitty one?

279
00:25:49.750 --> 00:25:51.670
It's my only chance!

280
00:25:53.050 --> 00:25:55.140
What is it? Tell me.

281
00:25:55.470 --> 00:25:57.390
All right. Let's do it.

282
00:25:57.390 --> 00:25:59.020
Huh? Do what?

283
00:25:59.020 --> 00:26:01.980
Kibi Dan, go!

284
00:26:04.980 --> 00:26:07.150
Okay! Here you go!

285
00:26:07.150 --> 00:26:09.900
Huh?! You pulled your cheek off!

286
00:26:14.350 --> 00:26:16.190
Take it! This is for you!

287
00:26:25.940 --> 00:26:27.780
What are you even trying to do?

288
00:26:42.290 --> 00:26:43.550
Now shake.

289
00:26:48.220 --> 00:26:51.970
You just
tamed that huge ape monster!

290
00:26:51.970 --> 00:26:54.130
I did it! I did it!

291
00:26:54.130 --> 00:26:57.090
I finally made pals
with the mountain baboon!

292
00:26:57.090 --> 00:26:59.800
Now he'll stop causing trouble for me!

293
00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:03.100
Yay! Yay!

294
00:27:03.100 --> 00:27:05.270
You're some kinda power-user, huh?

295
00:27:05.270 --> 00:27:07.940
And it looks like it's
a pretty handy one, too!

296
00:27:12.230 --> 00:27:15.320
Attaboy! You're our buddy now!

297
00:27:17.380 --> 00:27:20.830
Good monkey!

298
00:27:20.830 --> 00:27:22.340
Is that your dog?

299
00:27:22.630 --> 00:27:25.340
Yup! His name is Komachiyo!

300
00:27:27.340 --> 00:27:30.550
Hey, Komachiyo! I'm Luffy!

301
00:27:30.550 --> 00:27:32.970
Now let's be friends from here on out!

302
00:27:34.060 --> 00:27:39.560
Oh, by the way,
my name's Otama.

303
00:27:40.010 --> 00:27:43.490
Alrighty then, Otama!
It's real nice to meetcha!

304
00:27:43.490 --> 00:27:45.160
It's nice to meet you, too!

305
00:27:45.160 --> 00:27:47.450
Oh yeah! I got a quick question.

306
00:27:47.450 --> 00:27:50.000
I need to know if I
made it to Wano or not.

307
00:27:50.460 --> 00:27:52.210
"Made it to Wano"?

308
00:27:53.660 --> 00:27:56.450
Well, yeah! This is the Land of Wano!

309
00:27:56.450 --> 00:28:00.280
And the beach that we're on now
is in a region called Kuri!

310
00:28:00.930 --> 00:28:02.360
Got it, Big Bro?

311
00:28:02.360 --> 00:28:05.280
Yeah, it's great! I wasn't sure!

312
00:28:06.320 --> 00:28:09.610
I finally made it to the Land of Wano!

313
00:28:10.200 --> 00:28:12.570
I'm comin' for you, Kaido!

314
00:28:12.570 --> 00:28:14.120
Wait, "Big Bro"? The heck?

315
00:28:14.530 --> 00:28:18.000
When did I become
your big brother, huh?

316
00:28:19.040 --> 00:28:21.000
A big brother's a big brother.

317
00:28:21.300 --> 00:28:22.960
What's that even mean?

318
00:28:22.960 --> 00:28:24.590
Well, whatever, I guess.

319
00:28:24.590 --> 00:28:27.220
It just makes sense! Big Bro!

320
00:28:33.120 --> 00:28:36.740
The men at Kuri Beach.
We lost communication with them.

321
00:28:36.740 --> 00:28:40.000
I speculate that someone
may have taken them down!

322
00:28:40.000 --> 00:28:42.000
While there's no trace of a ship,

323
00:28:43.400 --> 00:28:45.610
Your thoughts, Boss? What should we do?

324
00:28:54.660 --> 00:28:57.330
Don't let word get back to Kaido.

325
00:29:00.750 --> 00:29:02.670
I'll take care of it.
